<title>HONG KONG: Tai Cheung year profit down 31.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Tai Cheung year profit down 31.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   44.0  vs  65.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    20.0  vs  20.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    274.1 vs  402.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		     591.3 vs  717.7</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tai Cheung Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 27 to September 2</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 2</p>
<p>NOTE - Tai Cheung Holdings is a property group.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 26 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of six cents) vs 25 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
